GAL16V8 ; gal type 
MSXGLUE ; second line, any text (max 8 char)

IO  WR  RD Ad2 A0  A1  Ad1 RTR RTS  GND
NC  NC  NC NC  NC  D1  D0  IO2 IO1 VCC

/IO1 = /IO * /WR * /Ad1 * /Ad2 * /A1 * /A0
/IO2 = /IO * /RD * /Ad1 * /Ad2 * /A1 * /A0

D0.T =  RTR
D0.E = /IO * /RD * /Ad1 * /Ad2 * /A1 * A0

D1.T =  RTS
D1.E = /IO * /RD * /Ad1 * /Ad2 * A1 * /A0


DESCRIPTION
Glue logic for input / output for MSX cartridge
 tristate output:  pinname.T
 tristate control: pinname.E

